      "summary": "The Winning is the sixth mini-album by South Korean singer IU released on February 20, 2024 through EDM and Kakao Entertainment. The project features five tracks, beginning with an electrifying rock song and ending with a sweet, romantic ballad. This is how The Winning could be briefly described. The project also features guest appearances by NewJeans' HYEIN, Joe Won Sun, and Patti Kim on track three, the only collaborations on the mini-album. The mini-album also was preceded by a promotional single «Love wins all,» released on January 24 of that year and featured a music video starring herself and BTS's <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/IU/The+Winning\">Read more on Last.fm</a>.",
      "content": "The Winning is the sixth mini-album by South Korean singer IU released on February 20, 2024 through EDM and Kakao Entertainment.\n\nThe project features five tracks, beginning with an electrifying rock song and ending with a sweet, romantic ballad. This is how The Winning could be briefly described. The project also features guest appearances by NewJeans' HYEIN, Joe Won Sun, and Patti Kim on track three, the only collaborations on the mini-album.\n\nThe mini-album also was preceded by a promotional single «Love wins all,» released on January 24 of that year and featured a music video starring herself and BTS's V. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/IU/The+Winning\">Read more on Last.fm</a>. User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply."
